  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">We are a nutrition company, that evolved from the founder&rsquo;s personal complications from C-section delivery and post paralysis. I<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">n this advanced world with prodigious gym equipment, we rely on the homemade recipes of Gritslim tea to look after your fitness and wellness from inside the body. Our team is greatly inspired by the muse for fitness and strengthened by the complications with weight and health as a mother which resulted in the reforming establishment of&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">THE GRIT EMPIRE LLC</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&bull; Product Description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Gritslim tea will boost your metabolism and energy, improve digestion, and burn belly fats. Its high antioxidants will flush toxins from your system and cleanse your internal organs.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">This unique composition provides natural body detoxification. Its all-natural and organic extracts are well known for their anti-inflammatory and antioxidant qualities. The addition of soluble fiber in Gritslim tea is designed to reduce appetite and minimize mindless snacking.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Consuming the tea before meals will begin to affect stomach &ldquo;stretch receptors&rdquo; which send a message to your brain that food is present. The soluble fiber enters the digestive tract after consumption and causes hormonal signals to be released to the hypothalamus which controls hunger, thirst, fatigue, sleep, and energy levels.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): AMAZON, WALLMART MARKET PLACE, GRITSLIM.SHOP, THEGRITEMPIRELLC.COM</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br>&bull; Payment terms:10% per sale</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">We are a San Diego-based company with many aspirations, narrowing down to our foremost&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">VISION&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 14px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- &ldquo;seeking to build an army of fit women, mothers in particular, and men who can learn to eat healthier for a lifestyle change and optimum performance.&rdquo; Upholding our fitness and wellness values, we provide excellent customer service rendering the utmost contentment.</span></p>\r\n</div>",
